meta {
  name: reservations
  seq: 15
}

docs {
  Public requests: no token needed, except "Create reservation - slot full" (admin). The staff/ subfolder logs in by itself. Expects the default settings (run the whole settings folder, its last request restores them).
  Dates are computed before each request and kept at least 2 days from today, so a run near midnight can't fail.
}
